msgid "# Kimi-K3 (Experimental)"
msgstr "# Kimi-K3（实验性）"

msgid ""
"!!! warning \"Experimental support\"\n"
"    Kimi K3 support in vLLM-Ascend `v0.27.1rc` is an initial experimental release. It is intended for evaluation and validation with the fixed deployment configurations in this guide. Supported scenarios, performance, and configuration interfaces may evolve in later releases; do not treat this guide as a production support commitment."
msgstr ""
"!!! warning \"实验性支持\"\n"
"    vLLM-Ascend `v0.27.1rc` 中的 Kimi K3 支持是初始实验性版本。它旨在使用本指南中的固定部署配置进行评估和验证。支持的场景、性能和配置接口可能会在后续版本中发生变化；请勿将本指南视为生产支持承诺。"

msgid ""
"Kimi K3 is a native multimodal Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) model. Its language "
"backbone combines Kimi Delta Attention (KDA) with periodic Gated Multi-head "
"Latent Attention (MLA), and uses Stable LatentMoE for expert computation. "
"The model also integrates a MoonViT vision encoder and supports text, image "
"understanding, reasoning, and tool calling."
msgstr ""
"Kimi K3 是一个原生多模态混合专家（MoE）模型。其语言主干网络结合了 Kimi Delta Attention（KDA）与周期性 Gated "
"Multi-head Latent Attention（MLA），并使用 Stable LatentMoE 进行专家计算。该模型还集成了 MoonViT"
" 视觉编码器，支持文本、图像理解、推理和工具调用。"

msgid ""
"This document will show the main verification steps of the model, including "
"supported features, feature configuration, environment preparation, multi-"
"node deployment on Atlas 800 A3, Atlas 800 A2, and Atlas 950DT, functional "
"verification, and AISBench evaluation."
msgstr ""
"本文档将展示该模型的主要验证步骤，包括支持的特性、特性配置、环境准备、在 Atlas 800 A3、Atlas 800 A2 和 Atlas 950DT"
" 上的多节点部署、功能验证以及 AISBench 评估。"

msgid ""
"This document is validated and written based on **vLLM-Ascend `v0.27.1rc`**."
msgstr "本文档基于 **vLLM-Ascend `v0.27.1rc`** 进行验证和编写。"

msgid ""
"The current release includes a subset of the Kimi K3 optimization features "
"that have been validated for this version. To provide a reproducible and "
"supportable baseline, this guide uses fixed deployment configurations "
"instead of exposing every tunable optimization."
msgstr ""
"当前版本包含已针对此版本验证的 Kimi K3 "
"优化特性的一个子集。为了提供可复现且可支持的基线，本指南使用固定的部署配置，而不是公开所有可调优的优化项。"

msgid ""
"These configurations position Kimi K3 for native multimodal inference, "
"reasoning and tool calling, and multi-node mixed Prefill/Decode or PD "
"separation deployments on Atlas 800 A3, A2, and Atlas 950DT. Additional "
"optimization features and configuration guidance will be added in later "
"releases after validation."
msgstr ""
"这些配置使 Kimi K3 能够在 Atlas 800 A3、A2 和 Atlas 950DT 上支持原生多模态推理、推理与工具调用，以及多节点混合 "
"Prefill/Decode 或 PD 分离部署。其他优化特性和配置指导将在后续版本经过验证后添加。"

msgid ""
"Refer to [supported "
"features](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md) to get the "
"model's supported feature matrix."
msgstr ""
"请参阅[支持的特性](../../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md)以获取该模型支持的特性矩阵。"

msgid ""
"Refer to [feature guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md) to get the"
" feature's configuration."
msgstr "请参阅[特性指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md)以获取该特性的配置。"

