msgid ""
"    | `--additional-config`                       | Enables Ascend CPU "
"binding and FlashComm1.                         |"
msgstr ""
"    | `--additional-config`                       | 启用 Ascend CPU 绑定和 "
"FlashComm1。                         |"

msgid ""
"    | `HCCL_IF_IP` and socket interface variables | Bind HCCL and Gloo "
"communication to the selected interface.      |"
msgstr "    | `HCCL_IF_IP` 和 socket 接口变量 | 将 HCCL 和 Gloo 通信绑定到所选接口。      |"

msgid ""
"!!! note\n"
"        Serving a 1M-token context requires at least eight Atlas 800 A3 (64G × 16) nodes. Change the following parameters on every node:"
msgstr ""
"!!! note\n"
"        服务 1M token 上下文至少需要八个 Atlas 800 A3（64G × 16）节点。在每个节点上更改以下参数："

