msgid "=== \"Atlas 800 A2 (eight-node)\""
msgstr "=== \"Atlas 800 A2（八节点）\""

msgid ""
"The validated Atlas 800 A2 deployment uses eight nodes with eight NPUs per "
"node. Each node runs one DP rank and uses all eight local NPUs for tensor "
"parallelism. Every DP rank handles both Prefill and Decode, resulting in a "
"DP8/TP8/EP64 topology. Node 0 runs the API server and DP rank 0, while Nodes"
" 1 through 7 run headless DP workers. This baseline serves the language "
"model only."
msgstr ""
"经验证的 Atlas 800 A2 部署使用八个节点，每个节点八个 NPU。每个节点运行一个 DP rank，并使用全部八个本地 NPU "
"进行张量并行。每个 DP rank 同时处理 Prefill 和 Decode，形成 DP8/TP8/EP64 拓扑。节点 0 运行 API 服务器和 "
"DP rank 0，而节点 1 到 7 运行无头 DP 工作节点。此基线仅服务语言模型。"

msgid ""
"- Replace the model path, local IP address, network interface, service port, and DP RPC port with values from the target environment.\n"
"    - `NIC_NAME` must be the interface that owns `LOCAL_IP`.\n"
"    - Start Node 0 first. The `NODE0_IP` configured on Nodes 1 through 7 must equal `LOCAL_IP` on Node 0.\n"
